## ⚠️ Pitfalls & Invariants
- **[NO_MANUAL_COLOR_GUESSING]**: Always extract `:root` CSS variables; never guess hex codes.
- **[NO_SYNTHETIC_STUBS]**: Do not declare completion with mock stubs when the user expects visual and behavioral parity.
- **[NO_COMPOSER_HORIZONTAL_CRAMP]**: Never compromise text input width for wide text buttons in side-panels; use compact circular icon triggers.
- **[MEMORY_PERSISTENCE]**: Store key reverse-engineered domain findings in SCONES memory.
